	)
	(text "Gain: R505/R506=0 and R501/R502=100k (divider). Rf R507/R508=0, Rg R509/R510 DNP -> x1. Attenuate: change R505 vs R501 (e.g. 100k/100k = x0.5). Gain>1: populate Rg and raise Rf. + pulldown is R501, not Rg."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(effects
